" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="KUJO — The Kujo system. Build with clarity. Operate with control."><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://invest.kujolang.ai/assets/deck/social/slide-05.ff0bfe41f516.png"><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="KUJO — The Kujo system. Build with clarity. Operate with control."></head><body class="ki-public-view"><a class="p-skip" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main id="main-content" class="p-viewer" data-motion="fade" data-duration="0.22" data-easing="easeOut" data-intensity="1" data-stagger="0.06" data-labels="&#123;&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;Presentation controls&quot;,&quot;exitFullscreen&quot;:&quot;Exit fullscreen&quot;,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:&quot;Fullscreen&quot;,&quot;fullscreenUnavailable&quot;:&quot;Fullscreen is unavailable. You can continue with the normal viewer.&quot;,&quot;help&quot;:&quot;← → Navigate · Space Next · Home / End · F Fullscreen&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;Image&quot;,&quot;next&quot;:&quot;Next →&quot;,&quot;notFound&quot;:&quot;Slide not found&quot;,&quot;off&quot;:&quot;off&quot;,&quot;on&quot;:&quot;on&quot;,&quot;overview&quot;:&quot;Overview&quot;,&quot;previous&quot;:&quot;← Previous&quot;,&quot;print&quot;:&quot;Print / PDF&quot;,&quot;progress&quot;:&quot;Presentation progress&quot;,&quot;readAll&quot;:&quot;Read the complete deck as text →&quot;,&quot;readText&quot;:&quot;Read text&quot;,&quot;reducedMotion&quot;:&quot;Reduced motion&quot;,&quot;replay&quot;:&quot;Replay entrance&quot;,&quot;skip&quot;:&quot;Skip to content&quot;,&quot;slideStatus&quot;:&quot;Slide &#123;slide&#125; of &#123;count&#125;&quot;,&quot;slides&quot;:&quot;slides&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;Start presentation ↗&quot;,&quot;transitions&quot;:&quot;Transitions&quot;&#125;" data-slide="5" data-count="18"><div class="p-stage"><div class="p-frame"><article class="p-canvas p-layout-ki-architecture"><header class="p-header"><span>KUJO</span><span>05 / The Kujo system</span><span dir="ltr">5 / 18</span></header><div class="ki-content"><h1>Build with clarity. Operate with control.</h1><p class="ki-lead">The language is the long-term foundation. Existing tools offer an earlier route into engineering workflows.</p><ol class="p-features"><li><span class="p-feature-number">01</span><div><h2>Clarity</h2><p>Kujo language / Spec / Eval: explicit intent and testable outcomes.</p></div></li><li><span class="p-feature-number">02</span><div><h2>Context</h2><p>MCP / CaseFile / RunLedger: useful inputs, debugging evidence and run records.</p></div></li><li><span class="p-feature-number">03</span><div><h2>Control</h2><p>Dispatch / Workcell / ShipCheck: orchestration, bounded execution and release checks.</p></div></li></ol><dl class="p-metrics"></dl></div><div class="ki-foundation">Existing repositories + coding agents <span>explicit component contracts</span> Kujo runtime + CLI</div><div class="ki-explore"><details><summary>Inspect the execution boundary</summary><p>Workcell owns supported container bounds. Dispatch owns workflow state. Neither confers enterprise certification.</p></details><details><summary>Inspect the evidence boundary</summary><p>CaseFile captures commands. Eval runs configured checks. RunLedger stores supplied outcomes. Artifacts remain separate.</p></details></div><div class="ki-resource"><a href="/assets/deck/appendix">Evidence & investor appendix ↗</a></div><footer class="p-footer"><span>KUJO / Investor briefing</span><span>T01–T14 · tool boundaries remain distinct</span><span>5</span></footer></article></div></div><nav class="ki-navigation" aria-label="Slide navigation"><a class="ki-arrow ki-previous" aria-label="Previous slide" data-variant="ghost" data-nav="previous" href="/4/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a><span class="p-counter" dir="ltr">5 / 18</span><a class="ki-arrow ki-next" aria-label="Next slide" data-variant="ghost" data-nav="next" href="/6/"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav><details class="ki-menu"><summary aria-label="Presentation options">⋯</summary><nav aria-label="Presentation editions"><a class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" href="/overview/">Overview</a><a class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" href="/reading/#slide-5">Read text</a><a class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" href="/print/">Print / PDF</a><button class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" data-fullscreen hidden type="button">Fullscreen</button><button class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" data-motion-toggle hidden type="button">Transitions</button><button class="sk-button" data-variant="ghost" data-replay hidden type="button">Replay entrance</button><a href="/presenter/">Presenter</a></nav></details><progress class="p-progress" max="18" value="5" aria-label="Presentation progress"></progress><p class="p-help">← → Navigate · Space Next · Home / End · F Fullscreen</p><p class="sk-sr-only" data-status role="status"></p></main><script src="/assets/presentation/viewer.js" defer></script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/vce701823e78c4301a35b7e07294d87301792088814092" integrity="sha512-UKNk8GbxkABxKcXYuLkO16EleLGUkcvJWtpSNmExE0Too3ZaFAxTscNWEc1OdAv5/BikHawapSCaiD2XCmp+Bw==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"1d30a17a0e01472db240809ad42c0b1f","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
